            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to ZombLabs!</h2>ZombLabs is an action packed Horror-Survival FPS. Fight your way through an epic battle against endless waves of zombies. Get ready for a ridiculous amount of fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/a9ab81c3dc72662dec860808f80089dd.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=120 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 different scenarios<br></li><li>Endless waves of various zombies and bosses<br></li><li>Many different Quests, Upgrades and Power Ups<br></li><li>Smooth gameplay with up to 60 FPS<br></li><li>64-bit Support<br></li><li>Ranking System and Online-highscore list<br></li><li>Lifetime free updates</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/40dced77874a863fddca9fc6b7eba70e.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=113 /></span><br><br>Fight your way through an epic battle in 6 different scenarios. Fight against the zombies in a castle, a World War II bunker, in an office, on a space station and more.<br>Each Scenario is different. Every Scenario comes with different types of Weapons, Zombies and Specials. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/6e86ecbff694d9f99723ff566462c190.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=153 /></span><br><br>In ZombLabs you fight against endless waves of various zombies and bosses. With every round the number and the strength of the zombies increases. The bosses are where it gets really interesting - with different and special attacks they try to force you to your knees<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/667a9029384d409395bf1f46933d3412.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=108 /></span><br><br>In the game, you will find different Quests which will give you extra points. The Quests make the game dynamic and bring the player to his limits. With the points you can buy upgrades and power ups. You also get points for every zombie that you killed. Be smart and survive as long as you can!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/c9bd357a65af6bb4ea55ad906bf70213.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=154 /></span><br><br>Fight against your friends and enemies for the best score. The game includes online highscore lists and a level system. Not interested? It is an optional feature. The game is still fully playable offline!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/e985a91d352dc68059e3de6a10ff44c3.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=120 /></span><br><br>Do we need to say anything else? Many achievements, 6 Steam Trading Cards, Profile Backgrounds, Badges and so much more! The complete Steam experience",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to ZombLabs!</h2>ZombLabs is an action packed Horror-Survival FPS. Fight your way through an epic battle against endless waves of zombies. Get ready for a ridiculous amount of fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/a9ab81c3dc72662dec860808f80089dd.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=120 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 different scenarios<br></li><li>Endless waves of various zombies and bosses<br></li><li>Many different Quests, Upgrades and Power Ups<br></li><li>Smooth gameplay with up to 60 FPS<br></li><li>64-bit Support<br></li><li>Ranking System and Online-highscore list<br></li><li>Lifetime free updates</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/40dced77874a863fddca9fc6b7eba70e.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=113 /></span><br><br>Fight your way through an epic battle in 6 different scenarios. Fight against the zombies in a castle, a World War II bunker, in an office, on a space station and more.<br>Each Scenario is different. Every Scenario comes with different types of Weapons, Zombies and Specials. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/6e86ecbff694d9f99723ff566462c190.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=153 /></span><br><br>In ZombLabs you fight against endless waves of various zombies and bosses. With every round the number and the strength of the zombies increases. The bosses are where it gets really interesting - with different and special attacks they try to force you to your knees<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/667a9029384d409395bf1f46933d3412.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=108 /></span><br><br>In the game, you will find different Quests which will give you extra points. The Quests make the game dynamic and bring the player to his limits. With the points you can buy upgrades and power ups. You also get points for every zombie that you killed. Be smart and survive as long as you can!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/c9bd357a65af6bb4ea55ad906bf70213.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=154 /></span><br><br>Fight against your friends and enemies for the best score. The game includes online highscore lists and a level system. Not interested? It is an optional feature. The game is still fully playable offline!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508620/extras/e985a91d352dc68059e3de6a10ff44c3.avif?t=1586880885\" width=591 height=120 /></span><br><br>Do we need to say anything else? Many achievements, 6 Steam Trading Cards, Profile Backgrounds, Badges and so much more! The complete Steam experience",
